From d945ac94ce5b5dff3c74401f83b8422181cb529d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Fabio M. Di Nitto" <fdinitto@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Dec 2025 14:16:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Remove discards const qualifier warnings
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

gcc 15.2.1 started producing warning about "assignment discards
‘const’ qualifier from pointer target type" so patch adds const
qualifier to fix this warning.

Signed-off-by: Fabio M. Di Nitto <fdinitto@redhat.com>
---
 agents/virt/server/virt-serial.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/agents/virt/server/virt-serial.c b/agents/virt/server/virt-serial.c
index bfcf4de26..17ac2b659 100644
--- a/agents/virt/server/virt-serial.c
+++ b/agents/virt/server/virt-serial.c
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@ struct domain_info {
 static int
 is_in_directory(const char *dir, const char *pathspec)
 {
-	char *last_slash = NULL;
+	const char *last_slash = NULL;
 	size_t dirlen, pathlen;
 
 	if (!dir || !pathspec)
